{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01BtUuoJcuNZ25zCYuTEdtoj","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_017ZK61EkvXZeUKDWvu9epDp","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"git commit -m \"$(cat <<'EOF'\nBatch MLE round kernels: replace per-AIR launches with descriptor-array batched kernels\n\nReplace ~15K per-AIR kernel launches in stacked reduction MLE rounds with\n2 batched launches per round using descriptor arrays. Each MLE round now\nlaunches one batched degenerate kernel (one block per AIR) and one batched\nnon-degenerate kernel (blocks mapped to AIRs via prefix-sum binary search).\n\nCUDA changes:\n- Add DegenMleDesc and NonDegenMleDesc descriptor structs\n- Add batched_degenerate_mle_round_kernel (grid=num_descs)\n- Add batched_nondegen_mle_round_kernel (grid=total_blocks, binary search)\n- Add corresponding extern \"C\" launcher functions\n\nRust changes:\n- Add #[repr(C)] descriptor structs and FFI bindings\n- Add compute_mle_launch_params() to replicate CUDA auto-tuning on CPU\n- Replace per-window loop with descriptor build + batched launch phases\n\nStacked reduction MLE rounds improved 2.09x at APC 300 (115ms -> 55ms),\n1.93x at APC 100, 1.55x at APC 0. No regression at any configuration.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\n)\"","description":"Commit implementation changes"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":139,"cache_read_input_tokens":106224,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":139},"output_tokens":62,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"03176189-f3e8-4185-8773-a32af1748382","uuid":"328002d1-b939-473d-a75d-41139525890f"}
